  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You've learned how to glom multiple green shoots into something that isn't quite a greenest shoot. You've decided to go with the comparative over the superlative and call them greener shoots.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Bound shikigami class feature, ability to produce 3+ green shoots daily</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you are about to produce green shoots, you may choose to produce a greener shoot instead of a green shoot. A greener shoot follows all of the rules for a green shoot, save that the chosen petition may have a base spirit point cost of up to 2 and that it is considered to be a wand of a 5thlevel spell (DC 17, CL 9th).</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/onmyodo-feats#toc28\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
